# --- Vault-side (§3.3) -------------------------------------------------------
# The pending staging directory MUST be gitignored. This is not hygiene: if
# staged files landed in the tracked tree, Obsidian Git's timer-based
# auto-commit would sweep them up and publish them without the review modal
# ever opening, defeating the gate that justifies the whole architecture.
#
# This entry also belongs in the .gitignore of the *vault* repo. `npm run
# start -w @notes/plugin -- --check-gitignore` and the plugin's own startup
# check both verify it there.
.publish-pending/
